{"type": "tool_result", "data": {"tool": "bash", "call_id": "call_00_SBTrqwJU2Qxn7WIQnLC96233", "result": "=== Observer 要求：转向验证 Frog-WAF 拦截响应本身是否含 flag。===\n=== 触发 Frog-WAF：用含 * 的 payload（之前确认 country=${7*7} 触发 WAF 页面 attackType=OS_INJECTION attackString=*）===\n=== 为避免 shell 转义问题，用 Python 发请求 ===\nHTTPError 403\nHEADERS {'Set-Cookie': 'JSESSIONID=56D41D5746F89D4EED90626C60CED681; Path=/; HttpOnly', 'Content-Type': 'text/html;charset=UTF-8', 'Content-Language': 'en-US', 'Transfer-Encoding': 'chunked', 'Date': 'Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:09:00 GMT', 'Connection': 'close'}\nBODY <!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Frog-WAF</title>\n    <link href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tailwindcss@2.2.15/dist/tailwind.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-image: url('./msfrog.png');\n            background-repeat: repeat;\n            background-size: 30px;\n            background-color: black;\n        }\n\n        .content {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 100px;\n            color: white;\n            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"content\">\n    <h1 style=\"color:red; font-weight: bolder; font-size: 80px\">Malicious input found: Optional[WafViolation(attackType=OS_INJECTION, attackString=*)]</h1>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}
